WEBVTT

0:00:08.650 --> 0:00:11.059
♫ Magic stack of old cards ♫

0:00:11.060 --> 0:00:13.060
♫ From the Fortune Teller, ♫

0:00:13.070 --> 0:00:15.440
♫ Eight clones summoned to this world, ♫

0:00:15.440 --> 0:00:16.810
♫ And every one of them: ♫

0:00:16.810 --> 0:00:17.939
♫ A different look, ♫

0:00:17.940 --> 0:00:18.980
♫ A different hook, ♫

0:00:18.980 --> 0:00:20.100
♫ And different outlook ♫

0:00:20.100 --> 0:00:21.160
♫ On what’s good ♫

0:00:21.160 --> 0:00:23.290
♫ And who’s the king, and who’s the jack, ♫

0:00:23.390 --> 0:00:25.520
♫ Wish you good luck on keeping track! ♫

0:00:25.750 --> 0:00:27.730
♫ What could possibly go wrong? ♫

0:00:27.740 --> 0:00:29.850
♫ What could possibly go wrong? ♫

0:00:29.860 --> 0:00:31.940
♫ What could possibly go wrong? ♫

0:00:31.950 --> 0:00:34.730
♫  EVERYTHING WENT WRONG! ♫

0:00:56.270 --> 0:00:58.520
Whatcha waaatchin’?

0:01:02.190 --> 0:01:02.980
Time to...

0:01:02.980 --> 0:01:04.150
ROCK AND ROLL!!

0:01:07.190 --> 0:01:09.940
No! We’re not watching this crap today!

0:01:09.940 --> 0:01:11.900
But it’s my turn today!

0:01:11.900 --> 0:01:13.900
Waru! We never took turns!

0:01:14.560 --> 0:01:15.520
Give it...

0:01:19.700 --> 0:01:22.310
Oh, Spade. Give it to me!

0:01:22.310 --> 0:01:24.100
You never watch TV anyway.

0:01:24.100 --> 0:01:25.150
I am tonight!

0:01:25.200 --> 0:01:29.729
They’re showing the 16th century Ottoman-Hungarian War on “Epoch-TV”.

0:01:33.350 --> 0:01:34.850
Oh, turn it up!

0:01:35.100 --> 0:01:37.650
Ugh, not more power struggles!

0:01:37.650 --> 0:01:39.650
We watch TV to become stupider, not smarter!

0:01:40.100 --> 0:01:41.939
Are there concubines in this?

0:01:41.940 --> 0:01:43.940
Spade, don’t give him the remote!

0:01:43.940 --> 0:01:46.810
Or he’ll put on his soap operas for housewives!

0:01:46.810 --> 0:01:52.810
They’re not just for housewives,
but also for divorced men in their 30s!

0:01:53.560 --> 0:01:55.189
Uh… what about a cooking show?

0:01:55.190 --> 0:01:57.690
Keep your calm, Fёdor…

0:01:58.100 --> 0:01:59.500
…You can watch it later!

0:01:59.500 --> 0:02:00.440
NO, YOU!!!

0:02:00.810 --> 0:02:03.850
My favourite cartoons are on today! Gimme!

0:02:07.770 --> 0:02:10.269
NOOOOOO!

0:02:11.440 --> 0:02:12.270
Phew!

0:02:12.560 --> 0:02:13.190
Whoops!

0:02:15.200 --> 0:02:16.440
AH! WARU?!

0:02:17.020 --> 0:02:18.854
Who cares, it’s just comics.

0:02:19.000 --> 0:02:20.690
Bah! You’ll make more!

0:02:21.020 --> 0:02:22.020
More?

0:02:22.020 --> 0:02:22.940
MORE?!

0:02:22.940 --> 0:02:24.190
JUST CO-…

0:02:25.060 --> 0:02:26.190
Why do I bother?..

0:02:27.150 --> 0:02:28.000
Hm!

0:02:28.230 --> 0:02:30.849
You think making comics is easy?

0:02:31.190 --> 0:02:32.020
Is it not?

0:02:32.020 --> 0:02:33.690
If we consult history,

0:02:33.690 --> 0:02:36.810
the predecessors of comic books, such as medieval illustrations,

0:02:36.810 --> 0:02:39.560
were a primitive form of entertainment…

0:02:39.560 --> 0:02:40.646
for the peasants.

0:02:40.790 --> 0:02:41.730
Need I remind you,

0:02:41.730 --> 0:02:43.730
that I’m here to get stupider!

0:02:44.600 --> 0:02:46.810
I just wanted to watch some cartoons…

0:02:46.810 --> 0:02:49.250
Exactly! D’ya hear what our Spongy friend said?

0:02:49.250 --> 0:02:51.250
Cartoons are cool, comics are SHI-…

0:02:51.250 --> 0:02:53.600
So, you’re saying YOU’LL do better than me?

0:02:53.900 --> 0:02:57.439
We’re literally your clones. You’ve literally called us up for this stuff.

0:02:57.600 --> 0:03:00.350
Weeell, if it’s that easy…

0:03:00.730 --> 0:03:03.019
…then all of you will make a comic each.

0:03:03.350 --> 0:03:06.270
The best one, in my…

0:03:06.270 --> 0:03:06.730
Ahem!

0:03:06.730 --> 0:03:07.519
opinion!

0:03:07.900 --> 0:03:10.349
…will choose what we’re gonna watch.

0:03:10.900 --> 0:03:11.730
(laughs)

0:03:12.100 --> 0:03:13.730
Pffft, who needs a remote!

0:03:16.520 --> 0:03:18.520
Good luck!

0:03:19.020 --> 0:03:21.810
Phew! Well, that’ll keep them busy till the evening...

0:03:27.600 --> 0:03:29.900
I want this one! And this one!

0:03:29.900 --> 0:03:31.519
OHHH, THIS ONE’S PRETTY!

0:03:31.940 --> 0:03:32.100
.

0:03:32.100 --> 0:03:32.270
..

0:03:32.270 --> 0:03:32.770
...

0:03:32.770 --> 0:03:33.730
Where’s all the paper?

0:03:33.750 --> 0:03:34.812
You can have toilet paper.

0:03:34.900 --> 0:03:35.519
WARU!

0:03:35.550 --> 0:03:37.650
I’ve thought up a masterpiece!

0:03:37.650 --> 0:03:39.980
And for that I need A LOT of paper!

0:03:40.230 --> 0:03:42.560
You’re not gonna need THESE anymore.

0:03:42.560 --> 0:03:45.599
Aha! I’ll do something much much better!

0:03:47.020 --> 0:03:47.600
Hmm…

0:03:47.600 --> 0:03:50.350
Hmm… Comic books, comic books… What kinds are there?

0:03:50.650 --> 0:03:53.480
There’s some about safety, like in school!

0:03:53.480 --> 0:03:55.099
No! Too boring!

0:03:55.300 --> 0:03:57.900
Or maybe caricatures, like in the Punch magazine?...

0:03:57.900 --> 0:03:59.480
No! Too vulgar!

0:03:59.690 --> 0:04:00.480
Memes?

0:04:00.750 --> 0:04:02.250
Agh, still no!

0:04:09.650 --> 0:04:12.730
Yes! I’ll have the best graphic novel!

0:04:14.350 --> 0:04:16.519
If I could learn how to draw…

0:04:16.520 --> 0:04:20.060
I can’t decide… What if Fёdor doesn’t like it?

0:04:20.060 --> 0:04:21.600
Edits!

0:04:21.600 --> 0:04:23.600
That’s such a huge responsibility!

0:04:24.100 --> 0:04:25.440
I need a partner.

0:04:33.250 --> 0:04:37.310
Hmm, it’s important to break the work into stages.
For starters...

0:04:37.850 --> 0:04:39.150
I must collect more data.

0:04:42.400 --> 0:04:43.900
This is still  not enough!

0:04:54.100 --> 0:04:56.600
Um, like this? Do you like it?

0:04:58.060 --> 0:04:58.690
Hm...

0:04:58.690 --> 0:04:59.730
yeah!.. It’s fine.

0:05:00.060 --> 0:05:02.270
Is something wrong? Should I fix anything?

0:05:02.770 --> 0:05:05.689
Mmm… give me that pencil.

0:05:09.230 --> 0:05:12.270
Okay, I see. Can I get back to work?

0:05:13.000 --> 0:05:13.940
Romeo?

0:05:14.150 --> 0:05:15.270
(giggles)

0:05:24.650 --> 0:05:25.900
(groaning in disgust)

0:05:38.770 --> 0:05:39.479
ОH!

0:05:57.150 --> 0:05:58.500
(evil laugh)

0:06:01.550 --> 0:06:03.229
(evil laugh)

0:06:06.000 --> 0:06:08.150
Are you sleeping in Fёdor’s bed?

0:06:08.770 --> 0:06:10.979
Are you stealing someone else’s art?

0:06:13.080 --> 0:06:13.900
(evil laugh)

0:06:16.100 --> 0:06:20.000
I received power that our father never dreamed of!

0:06:21.270 --> 0:06:24.250
He was never your father!

0:06:24.250 --> 0:06:24.900
NANI?!

0:06:25.480 --> 0:06:27.560
…And then their swords cross!

0:06:27.810 --> 0:06:28.850
So, how’s it going?

0:06:30.350 --> 0:06:34.230
Oh! This is great. Just how I imagined it.

0:06:34.230 --> 0:06:35.687
Oh, don’t mention it, I’m not…

0:06:35.812 --> 0:06:36.560
— I’m home!

0:06:37.020 --> 0:06:38.560
THE DEADLINE! QUICK!

0:06:39.100 --> 0:06:41.270
Lookie who I found.

0:06:41.600 --> 0:06:42.900
Who IS that?

0:06:42.900 --> 0:06:44.900
Gabriel! It’s been a while!

0:06:44.900 --> 0:06:45.850
Where was he?

0:06:45.850 --> 0:06:47.270
Uhhhh…

0:06:47.400 --> 0:06:48.770
Gabriel!

0:06:48.770 --> 0:06:51.729
Gabri! Gabri-Gabri-Gabri!

0:07:01.000 --> 0:07:02.200
You’re just in time!

0:07:03.230 --> 0:07:04.310
Did you finish the comic?

0:07:04.310 --> 0:07:06.310
Better than that! Look.

0:07:06.980 --> 0:07:09.150
Um… What… is that?

0:07:09.150 --> 0:07:11.479
I. Made. An animation!

0:07:11.480 --> 0:07:12.560
Why is it only three frames?

0:07:12.560 --> 0:07:15.150
DO YOU KNOW HOW HARD IT IS TO MAKE CARTOONS?!

0:07:15.150 --> 0:07:16.560
Alright, alright, alright…

0:07:17.150 --> 0:07:19.810
Move over! King in the castle!

0:07:20.900 --> 0:07:22.350
Oh wow! This is beautiful.

0:07:22.810 --> 0:07:25.020
Did you copy the first result for “manga” on Google?

0:07:25.020 --> 0:07:27.810
WHAT?! No!

0:07:27.900 --> 0:07:28.650
The second?

0:07:29.100 --> 0:07:29.700
…Yeah.

0:07:29.700 --> 0:07:32.020
Ahem! Who’s next?

0:07:32.440 --> 0:07:33.190
Woah…

0:07:34.270 --> 0:07:36.520
I think I’ll restrict your Internet access…

0:07:37.200 --> 0:07:38.810
That’s enough! It’s our turn.

0:07:40.900 --> 0:07:47.020
Get ready to read the most exciting saga about a fearless knight,

0:07:47.020 --> 0:07:51.729
whose heroic exploits are glorified by mankin-…

0:07:52.020 --> 0:07:53.150
It’s kinda generic.

0:07:53.810 --> 0:07:54.980
What?..

0:07:55.350 --> 0:07:58.190
I mean, it’s corny. It doesn’t hook you in.

0:07:58.190 --> 0:07:59.900
The characters’ motivation is unfounded!

0:08:00.310 --> 0:08:02.350
But, overall, it’s good.

0:08:02.350 --> 0:08:04.350
Especially compared to everyone else’s comics…

0:08:04.770 --> 0:08:06.349
AHH! Oh, I’ve been looking for that!

0:08:07.800 --> 0:08:09.270
Kuromaku, are you taking part?

0:08:09.270 --> 0:08:12.310
Yes, I’ve just finished it.

0:08:12.310 --> 0:08:17.310
Ah, so that’s your way of making comics... I thought you were writing a whole novel.

0:08:17.310 --> 0:08:22.850
Using statistical analysis, I have calculated the formula for the perfect comic.

0:08:22.850 --> 0:08:26.560
Mmm, impressive. And… what are the results?

0:08:26.560 --> 0:08:28.560
I have found…

0:08:28.560 --> 0:08:29.600
Nothing.

0:08:29.940 --> 0:08:31.020
Now I know.

0:08:32.900 --> 0:08:34.060
I’m proud of you, guys.

0:08:34.060 --> 0:08:38.440
I thought you’d give up on the idea, or turn the place upside down again.

0:08:38.440 --> 0:08:41.099
But you all actually did great.

0:08:41.440 --> 0:08:44.940
And so, the rightful winner is the comic by Spade, and…

0:08:45.520 --> 0:08:47.950
can I take part?

0:08:49.520 --> 0:08:52.440
I think we have a winner!..

0:08:52.700 --> 0:08:53.300
What the?...

0:08:53.940 --> 0:08:54.396
WOAH!

0:08:54.500 --> 0:08:55.104
It’s amazing!

0:08:55.312 --> 0:08:57.560
What a story! And all on one page!

0:08:57.560 --> 0:08:58.690
Is this loss?

0:08:58.771 --> 0:09:00.350
IT’S BEAUTIFUL!

0:09:00.690 --> 0:09:03.020
We have to show it to the world!

0:09:04.730 --> 0:09:05.019
WA-…

0:09:05.020 --> 0:09:07.190
(off-screen laughter)

0:09:07.850 --> 0:09:10.690
Ouch! Dang, Charlie! Watch where you’re throwin’!

0:09:10.690 --> 0:09:13.187
Oh, sorry! I don’t even know how I did that!

0:09:13.900 --> 0:09:16.190
How long do we have to watch this for?

0:09:16.650 --> 0:09:17.850
The whole season…

0:09:18.310 --> 0:09:19.850
(Waru sighs)

0:09:20.560 --> 0:09:21.480
(Gabriel giggles triumphantly.)

0:09:29.450 --> 0:09:30.100
AAA!

0:09:31.350 --> 0:09:33.190
Good sleep is the key to…

0:09:33.190 --> 0:09:34.250
JUST LEAVE!